+/*
+ * Address bases for the memo scan: a temp's base is the (temp, version)
+ * it was derived from by adds of a constant and moves, so the words of an
+ * ldm/stm (addr += 4) and the fields of one struct (r1 + 4, r1 + 8) share
+ * one, while an access through another register does not and would only
+ * pay the memo test to miss it.
